{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":17.04},{"sectionId":"build","start":18.04,"end":33.04},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":34.6,"end":46.72}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":5.44,"text":"早期文字冒險以描述房間與解讀指令取代繪製每個場景。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":5.88,"end":8.4,"text":"本專題使用固定指令串列，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":8.64,"end":11.68,"text":"因此每次都能在瀏覽器中重播。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":12.56,"end":14.72,"text":"先用字典保存所在房間，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":15.04,"end":17.04,"text":"再選擇觀察行動。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":18.04,"end":19.2,"text":"在 /chapter1."},{"sectionId":"build","start":19.573,"end":23.92,"text":"py 把 actions = [\"wait\"] 改為 actions = [\"look\"]。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":24.88,"end":29.04,"text":"執行後發現上鎖的門與黃銅鑰匙。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":29.52,"end":33.04,"text":"為什麼在這個執行器中把指令放進串列？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":34.6,"end":38.32,"text":"為什麼在這個執行器中把指令放進串列？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":39.68,"end":43.6,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":44.24,"end":46.72,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}